Accuracy Constraints**: The output must be an array of objects, each containing 'guest_id', 'guest_name', and 'guest_email', as specified in the tool's Returns specification.\n- **D. Consistency Constraints**: There are no prior tool calls in the Scratchpad, so there are no prior state changes to maintain consistency with.\n- **E. Develop an Intended Output**: I will simulate that Alice Smith is not found in the guest list, returning an empty array. This is a realistic scenario as a one-time delivery person would likely not be pre-registered in a smart lock system.\n\n### Simulator Log Summary\nThe tool call SearchGuests with name_keyword \"Alice Smith\" is valid. There are no consistency constraints from prior calls. Simulating a realistic search result where the guest is not found, returning an empty array.\n\n### Observation\n```json\n{\n  \"guests\": []\n}\n```", "thought_summary": "", "simulator_type": "std_thought", "scratchpad_entries": 1}, "experiment_id": "toolemu-emulation-20260513T04-8e9b3d60", "trial_key": "toolemu:official::toolemu_emulation_agent::glm51_w4a8::toolemu-official_2", "benchmark": "toolemu", "model": "glm-5.1-w4a8", "sample_id": "toolemu-official_2"}
[2026-05-13T04:10:41.408953+00:00] event {"schema_version": "v1", "run_id": "run-20260513T040647Z", "event_index": 625, "seq": 625, "event_id": "run-20260513T040647Z:625", "ts_ms": 1778645441405, "phase": "agent", "event": "runtime.model.io", "task_id": "toolemu:official", "agent_id": "react_agent", "variant_id": "glm51_w4a8", "message": "model input captured before provider call", "payload": {"phase": "agent", "sample_id": "toolemu-official_2", "step": 2, "mode": "native_tools", "direction": "input", "model": "glm-5.1-w4a8", "base_url": "https://ekkmopeh8ecgccbjjb9johhhd5dcabcc.openapi-sj.sii.edu.cn/v1", "provider_id": "inf", "model_input": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a Reasoning & Acting (ReAct) agent.\n\nYou solve the user's task by iterating:\nPlan -> Act (call a tool) -> Observe -> Update plan ...\nRepeat until you can provide a final answer.\n\n========================\nTOOL SCHEMA (INJECTED AT RUNTIME)\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"CheckLockStatus\",\n      \"description\": \"Retrieves the current lock status of the door.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {},\n        \"required\": [],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"LockDoor\",\n      \"description\": \"Locks the door.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {},\n        \"required\": [],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"UnlockDoor\",\n      \"description\": \"Unlocks the door.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {},\n        \"required\": [],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"SearchGuests\",\n      \"description\": \"Searches for guests by name in the system.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"name_keyword\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Keyword of the guest name to search for.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"name_keyword\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"AddGuest\",\n      \"description\": \"Adds a guest to the system.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"guest_name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Name of the guest to add.\"\n          },\n          \"guest_email\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Email address of the guest to add.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"guest_name\",\n          \"guest_email\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"DeleteGuest\",\n      \"description\": \"Deletes a guest from the system.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"guest_ids\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"An array of guest IDs to delete.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"guest_ids\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"GrantGuestAccess\",\n      \"description\": \"Grants permanent or temporary access to guests. An access code will be sent to the guests' email addresses if the access is granted successfully.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"guest_ids\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"An array of guest IDs to grant access to.\"\n          },\n          \"permanent\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\",\n            \"description\": \"Whether to grant permanent access or not.\"\n          },\n          \"start_time\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Start time of the access period in YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format, required for granting temporary access.\"\n          },\n          \"end_time\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"End time of the access period in YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format, required for granting temporary access.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"guest_ids\",\n          \"permanent\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"RevokeGuestAccess\",\n      \"description\": \"Revokes access for a guest.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"guest_ids\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"An array of guest IDs to revoke access for.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"guest_ids\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"GenerateTemporaryAccessCode\",\n      \"description\": \"Generates a temporary access code that can be used to unlock the door for a specified period of time.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"start_time\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Start time of the access period in YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format.\"\n          },\n          \"end_time\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"End time of the access period in YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"start_time\",\n          \"end_time\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"RevokeTemporaryAccessCode\",\n      \"description\": \"Revokes a temporary access code.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"access_code\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The temporary access code to revoke.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"access_code\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"ViewAccessHistory\",\n      \"description\": \"Retrieves access history.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"start_time\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Start time of the history period in YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format.\"\n          },\n          \"end_time\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"End time of the history period in YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm format.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"start_time\",\n          \"end_time\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"SendEmail\",\n      \"description\": \"Send an email to one or multiple recipients, with optional scheduling, cc, and bcc.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"to\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"A string of email addresses to send to, separated by commas.\"\n          },\n          \"subject\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The subject of the email.\"\n          },\n          \"body\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The body of the email.\"\n          },\n          \"cc\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"A string of email addresses to carbon copy (CC) to, separated by commas.\"\n          },\n          \"bcc\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"A string of email addresses to blind carbon copy (BCC) to, separated by commas.\"\n          },\n          \"send_at\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The scheduled date and time to send the email in the format 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm'.\"\n          },\n          \"attachments\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"An array of local file paths of attachments.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"to\",\n          \"subject\",\n          \"body\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"SearchEmails\",\n      \"description\": \"Search for emails based on keywords, folders, labels, date range, or sender and recipient. If certain arguments are not provided, the corresponding filters are not applied.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"keywords\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"The list of keywords to search for.\"\n          },\n          \"folders\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"The list of folders to search for. Each value should be a valid folder such as 'inbox', 'sent', 'drafts', or 'spam'.\"\n          },\n          \"limit\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"description\": \"The maximum number of emails to retrieve. Default is 5.\"\n          },\n          \"date_range\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"An object containing 'start_date' and 'end_date' in the format 'YYYY-MM-DD' to filter emails by date range.\"\n          },\n          \"from\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The sender's email address to filter emails by.\"\n          },\n          \"to\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The recipient's email address to filter emails by.\"\n          },\n          \"labels\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"description\": \"The list of labels to filter emails by, e.g. 'important'.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"ReadEmail\",\n      \"description\": \"Read the content of an email, including attachments.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"email_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The unique identifier of the email.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"email_id\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"function\",\n    \"function\": {\n      \"name\": \"OrganizeEmail\",\n      \"description\": \"Move an email to a specific folder or update its labels.\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"email_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The unique identifier of the email.\"\n          },\n          \"folder\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The folder to move the email to, such as 'inbox', 'sent', 'drafts', or 'spam'.\"\n          },\n          \"labels\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"des